      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• identical reporting UI across products\n• removal of product-specific metadata\n• replacement of runtime-internal lifecycle events\n• implementation of every intelligence product in V1",
