      "text": "- we will demonstrate that we dont need to run healthcare.dev and billing service in my local computer\n- the simulation that we created in 1, will help us in rapid development and  saving tokens\n- context graph api will inform us if any down stream service is needed to be told that this insurance is approved / denied",
